				<title>水调歌头·霖霖歌</title>
				<link>http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/wanderers:rainer</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;霖霖绕风来，簌簌歌月去，试问流水三千，繁花何时尽？欲寻湖中一亭，回首了无凭语，杯装诗乐酒，何处对月饮？独留自翩翩。&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;忆锦瑟，怀秋心，念执笔，涟漾成漪，绵绵缠思盗光影。烟花易冷岁末，雨花易寒心头，只催人话梦，再醒雨弦断，复唱来时歌。&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/virgil-n&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5661227&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607931042&quot; alt=&quot;Virgil_N&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5661227)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/virgil-n&quot;  &gt;Virgil_N&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
